 it protects all of them. Two habits do most of the work: turning on 2-Step Verification and signing out of shared computers."}],["$","ol","2",{"start":"$undefined","className":"list-decimal pl-6 space-y-3 text-gray-700 marker:font-semibold marker:text-primary-600","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Open a web browser and go to drive.google.com (or any Google app, such as mail.google.com)."}],["$","li","1",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"In Email or phone, type your account address and click Next."}],["$","li","2",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Type your password and click Next."}],["$","li","3",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"If 2-Step Verification is on, complete the second step, such as tapping Yes on your phone."}],["$","li","4",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"The app opens. Your profile picture or initial at the top right shows which account you are using."}]]}],["$","$L1f","3",{"block":{"type":"drag-drop","mode":"order","title":"Put the sign-in steps in order","prompt":"Drag the steps into the order you do them.","items":[{"id":"s1","text":"Go to drive.google.com in a browser"},{"id":"s2","text":"Type your email address and click Next"},{"id":"s3","text":"Type your password and click Next"},{"id":"s4","text":"Tap Yes on the prompt on your phone"},{"id":"s5","text":"Check the profile picture at the top right"}],"explanation":"Email first, then password, then the second step. Checking the profile picture confirms you are in the right account, which matters when a computer has been used by someone else."}}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6","children":"2-Step Verification"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"With 2-Step Verification, signing in takes something you know (your password) and something you have (usually your phone). If someone steals or guesses your password, they still cannot get in without the second step."}],"$L20","$L21","$L22"]}]]}],"$L23","$L24"]}]}]]}]
